WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.834
This last video covers three things in Settings. Logins for your team, saved messages, and automatic replies to keywords.

00:00:08.984 --> 00:00:21.210
Settings is split into tabs along the top. The first tab controls the AI. Whether it may send by itself, how long it waits before replying, and whether it types at a human speed.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:32.562
In Team, add a login for each person. Choose which screens they can open, and whether they see every lead or only their own. The first account you create becomes the owner.

00:00:32.712 --> 00:00:43.743
Shortcuts are messages you send often. Save one with a short name, then type a forward slash and that name in any reply box. The lead's details are filled in for you.

00:00:43.893 --> 00:00:54.669
Keyword replies answer straight away. When a lead sends a word you choose, such as guide, your saved reply goes out at once, and the lead can be tagged at the same time.

00:00:54.819 --> 00:01:02.245
Conversion links are the places you send leads, the same list as in your business brief. Add as many as you need.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:09.906
If you ever need a reminder, open Video guides in the menu. Every part of the tool has a short video like this one.
